'''Black Thunder Rider''' (迅雷の黒騎馬兵 Jinrai no kuro kiba-hei) is an enemy appearing in the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Black Thunder Rider
|image = E 223.png
|appearance = [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy is pretty much an exact copy of its [[Castle Horseman (Enemy)|other counterpart]], just with slightly higher stats.

==Strategy==
The strategy used to defeat the original Horseman enemy can also be used for this enemy as the only difference is a small increase in stats.

